    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Designation Force",
    "summary": "Your **SCOUT SENTINEL** units, and those of your units that are **ASTRA MILITARUM INFANTRY SMOKE**, have **Signal Flares**, which lets such a unit, during your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), choose one enemy unit it can see within 12\", and that enemy becomes **designated**; a **designated** unit's detection range is increased by 3\". This Detachment carries the **RECON** tag, so it cannot be combined with another **RECON** Detachment. The card does not say how long a unit stays **designated**.",
